# /app is a REDIRECT to the platform origin, never a reverse proxy. Proxying
# would put the authenticated dashboard on the same origin as this OSS-built
# static site, letting a compromised package ride (or mint, via /auth/v1/token)
# the user's session. See laika-cloud decisions/0028.
/app https://app.laikacms.com/ 301
/app/* https://app.laikacms.com/:splat 301
